17;&#x5177;&#x6709;&#x8c61;&#x5fb5;&#x610f;&#x7fa9;&#x7684;&#x5916;&#x4ea4;&#x6d3b;&#x52d5;&#x3002;</p>]]></content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[一物一念：從熟悉的詞與物件出發，打開一段未盡的故事]]></title><description><![CDATA[那些重要的人生片段，你都用什麼方式記住，又用什麼方式講述？]]></description><link>https://theinitium.com/20260925-life-slices/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">6ab5273b1a5a1e000137a3d4</guid><category><![CDATA[活動]]></category><category><![CDATA[專題記者成長計劃]]></category><category><![CDATA[一物一念]]></category><category><![CDATA[互動頁面]]></category><dc:creator><![CDATA[Fumi]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 22:58:00 GMT</pubDate><media:content url="https://storage.ghost.io/c/bd/52/bd52a4c1-eed6-4103-b487-e9a77365f6b3/content/images/2026/09/cms-2-.jpg" medium="image"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<img src="https://storage.ghost.io/c/bd/52/bd52a4c1-eed6-4103-b487-e9a77365f6b3/content/images/2026/09/cms-2-.jpg" alt="&#x4e00;&#x7269;&#x4e00;&#x5ff5;&#xff1a;&#x5f9e;&#x719f;&#x6089;&#x7684;&#x8a5e;&#x8207;&#x7269;&#x4ef6;&#x51fa;&#x767c;&#xff0c;&#x6253;&#x958b;&#x4e00;&#x6bb5;&#x672a;&#x76e1;&#x7684;&#x6545;&#x4e8b;"><p></p>]]></content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[「理解」，是我們處理一段經驗的終點嗎？]]></title><description><![CDATA[我們越來越擅長替情緒找到一個「名字」。當一段經歷能夠被歸類和解釋，也仍然有許多細枝末節的感受，留在這些詞語之外。 ]]></description><link>https://theinitium.com/20260925-life-slices-beginnings/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">6ab52b681a5a1e000137a42b</guid><category><![CDATA[活動]]></category><category><![CDATA[專題記者成長計劃]]></category><category><![CDATA[一物一念]]></category><dc:creator><![CDATA[Fumi]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 22:57:00 GMT</pubDate><media:content url="https://storage.ghost.io/c/bd/52/bd52a4c1-eed6-4103-b487-e9a77365f6b3/content/images/2026/09/001.JPG" medium="image"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-blue"><div class="kg-callout-text">&#x6211;&#x662f;Fumi&#x3002;&#x559c;&#x6b61;&#x89c0;&#x5bdf;&#x4eba;&#x5728;&#x7fa4;&#x9ad4;&#x548c;&#x793e;&#x6703;&#x4e2d;&#x7522;&#x751f;